    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Null Maiden Vigil",
    "summary": "As you muster your army, you may pick an ANATHEMA PSYKANA CHARACTER model of yours as your WARLORD. PROSECUTOR SQUAD units in your army gain the BATTLELINE keyword. Every friendly ANATHEMA PSYKANA unit carries the Creeping Dread (Aura) ability: during the opponent's Command phase, at its Battle-shock step, every enemy PSYKER unit, and every enemy unit below its starting strength, within 12\" of that ANATHEMA PSYKANA unit must roll for battle-shock, taking -1 on that roll.",
